   "n": 31,
   "html": "A balança está em equilíbrio. As <b>3 caixas</b> têm a mesma massa.<div class=\"row\"><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"282\" height=\"142\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 142\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"102\" y=\"130\" width=\"80\" height=\"9\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#9aa5b8\"/><rect x=\"139\" y=\"38\" width=\"6\" height=\"94\" fill=\"#c9cbd6\"/><path d=\"M62 38 h160\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"142\" cy=\"38\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#e5506a\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M62 38 L14 96 M62 38 L112 96 M222 38 L176 96 M222 38 L268 96\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M8 96 h110 q-4 14 -55 14 q-51 0 -55 -14 Z M170 96 h104 q-4 14 -52 14 q-48 0 -52 -14 Z\" fill=\"#d9dde6\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"14\" y=\"72\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f4a261\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"25.5\" y=\"89.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">?</text><rect x=\"39\" y=\"72\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f4a261\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"50.5\" y=\"89.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">?</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"72\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#f4a261\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"75.5\" y=\"89.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">?</text><path d=\"M89 95 l3 -22 h20 l3 22 Z\" fill=\"#8a93a6\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"102.0\" y=\"90.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"9.5\" fill=\"#fff\">2 kg</text><path d=\"M198 95 l5 -34 h38 l5 34 Z\" fill=\"#8a93a6\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"214\" y=\"54\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#8a93a6\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"222.0\" y=\"85.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#fff\">14 kg</text></svg><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Tirando 2 kg de cada lado, as 3 caixas pesam <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"12\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> kg</div><div>b) Cada caixa pesa <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"4\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:50px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> kg</div></div></div>",
   "gab": "a) 12 kg · b) 4 kg"
