  {
   "n": 32,
   "html": "Descubra o número que falta em cada igualdade:<div class=\"grid\"><div><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"36\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> + 27 = 63</div><div>5 × <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"17\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> = 85</div><div><input class=\"in\" data-a=\"48\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> ÷ 4 = 12</div><div>100 − <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"63\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> = 37</div></div>",
   "gab": "36 · 17 · 48 · 63"
  },
  {
   "n": 33,
   "html": "Sabemos que <b>12 + 8 = 20</b>. Complete para que as igualdades continuem verdadeiras:<div class=\"grid\"><div>12 + 8 + 5 = 20 + <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"5\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>(12 + 8) × 3 = 20 × <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"3\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>12 + 8 − 7 = 20 − <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"7\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>(12 + 8) ÷ 2 = 20 ÷ <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"2\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:44px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
   "gab": "5 · 3 · 7 · 2"
  },
  {
   "n": 34,
   "html": "Pensei em um número, multipliquei por 3 e depois somei 5. O resultado foi 26.<div><svg class=\"ill\" width=\"372\" height=\"68\" viewBox=\"0 0 372 68\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"34\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#8E4EC6\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"41.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#8E4EC6\">?</text><path d=\"M58 34 h26 m-7 -6 l8 6 l-8 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"92\" y=\"12\" width=\"74\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3e9fb\" stroke=\"#8E4EC6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"129.0\" y=\"41.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">× 3</text><path d=\"M170 34 h26 m-7 -6 l8 6 l-8 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><rect x=\"204\" y=\"12\" width=\"74\" height=\"44\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f3e9fb\" stroke=\"#8E4EC6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"241.0\" y=\"41.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"600\" font-size=\"19\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">+ 5</text><path d=\"M282 34 h26 m-7 -6 l8 6 l-8 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2b2b3a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"342\" cy=\"34\" r=\"24\" fill=\"#ffcf33\" stroke=\"#c99a1a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"342.0\" y=\"41.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Fredoka\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#2b2b3a\">26</text></svg></div><div class=\"ql\"><div>a) Antes de somar 5, o valor era <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"21\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><div>b) O número em que pensei foi <input class=\"in\" data-a=\"7\" data-t=\"n\" style=\"width:56px\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div></div>",
